    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 44 Answer: Help Polly gather enough cookies</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Scene confirmed on screen: green parrot on a perch in a kitchen, mouse hole, tooth-fairy painting, oven, broom, gingerbread man, trash can and sink — every object the steps name is present. The closing story card ('Polly wants a romantic date') marks the level end at 1:15. Frames were sampled every 5 s, so the timestamps are accurate to about ±5 s.</div>
