    <h2>Level 44 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 1</span>
      <strong>Steps 1–6: Move the cookie on the table to the parrot</strong>
      <p>Move the cookie on the table to the parrot; then Move the cookie on the floor to the parrot; then Move the cookie from the cat bowl to the parrot; then Move the cheese to the mouse hole; then Move the cookie dropped by the mouse to the parrot; then Move the tooth to the tooth fairy in the painting</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 2</span>
      <strong>Steps 7–11: Move the cookie left by the tooth fairy to the parrot</strong>
